<Input><Text-field prompt="&gt; " style="Maple Input" layout="Normal">#To find the beta coefficients, we need to solve whatever equations these coefficientes have to satisfy to be consistent with the fact that we want this method to be accurate up to order n+1, or have an error of order n+1 in h.#Therefore, we need to express the error of this method as the actual value of the function y in x+h, then subsract the approxiamte value that involves the beta parameters, expand as a Taylor series around x, and find the conditions so that all the terms of order less than n+2 vanish.</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group>
